WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
 What I think we'll be looking for a year

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:07.560
 from now is an ecosystem across Chicago

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.040
 that feels

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.920
 heard and feels connected to the

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.640
 community, and that when they're in their

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.760
 most challenging

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.620
 moments, they'll be able to be met with

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.410
 empathy, expertise, and a department that's

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:18.640
 willing

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.950
 to make sure that they have their needs

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.120
 in front of them.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.580
 My goal has been able to make sure that

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.180
 people understand how we're closing the

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:25.920
 life expectancy

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:26.920
 gap.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.090
 Making sure that people understand those

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.370
 drivers such as chronic disease, gun

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.120
 violence, mental

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:34.980
 health, and how we're able to show up for

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:35.960
 all of them.

